     THE CLIENT'S OWN CATALOGUE, three subdivisions of the six they specified
     for task #87 on 2026-08-14. Payment, "Llegar y aparcar" and "Servicios al
     cliente" were asked back out on 2026-08-17: the first two repeat what the
     microsite already says on its own blocks, and a list long enough to need
     reading is a list nobody reads. "Aseos para clientes" went with them.

     What is left is what a shopper wants to know before walking in: whether
     they can get in, whether they will be comfortable, and whether they can
     bring who they are bringing.

     Nothing was deleted. Everything retired is ARCHIVED by the migration in
     19.0.2.0.0, relations intact, so a shop that had ticked one gets it back
     the day somebody changes their mind.

     Written in English on purpose. Odoo keeps en_US as the technical base of
     every translatable column, so a record seeded in Spanish has its Spanish
     sitting in the base, exactly where an English translation later lands on
     top of it. That is how 2134 records lost their Spanish on 2026-08-14.
     English here, the client's own Spanish wording in i18n/es.po, and nothing
     can overwrite anything.

     noupdate: renaming an item is the client's to do, and a module update must
     not undo it. It also means this file cannot RENAME or MOVE a record that
     already exists, the migration does that. -->
<odoo noupdate="1">

    <!-- ============ Accessibility ============ -->
    <record id="category_accessibility" model="company.facility.category">
        <field name="name">Accessibility</field>
        <field name="icon">fa-universal-access</field>
        <field name="sequence">10</field>
    </record>

    <record id="facility_access_ramp" model="company.facility">
        <field name="name">Access ramp</field>
        <field name="category_id" ref="category_accessibility"/>
        <field name="icon">fa-wheelchair</field>
        <field name="sequence">10</field>
    </record>
    <record id="facility_lift" model="company.facility">
        <field name="name">Elevator</field>
        <field name="category_id" ref="category_accessibility"/>
